import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 855 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 855 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom","no":855,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Law-First Axiom","Setting Self-Consistency","No Setting-Breaking","Meta-Law"],"related":["709-Unity of Transcendence and the Law-First Axiom","759-Practice of the Law-First Axiom","97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","851-Transcended-One Philosophy Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0855_模块4-超脱者与哲学-法则优先公理深度.md","filePath":"en/0855_模块4-超脱者与哲学-法则优先公理深度.md"}'),s={name:"en/0855_模块4-超脱者与哲学-法则优先公理深度.md"};function o(l,e,r,h,c,d){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-855-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-philosophical-depth-of-the-law-first-axiom" tabindex="-1">Entry 855 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-855-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-the-philosophical-depth-of-the-law-first-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 855 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | The Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 709, 759, 851</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-even-the-act-of-setting-a-cosmos-itself-must-obey-laws" tabindex="-1">Introduction: even the act of &quot;setting a cosmos&quot; itself must obey laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-even-the-act-of-setting-a-cosmos-itself-must-obey-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: even the act of &quot;setting a cosmos&quot; itself must obey laws&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the five axioms, the most special is <strong>the law-first axiom</strong>. It does not directly talk ethics like the first four; it talks a meta-rule — <strong>laws are above all, including the storyteller himself.</strong> The old worldview&#39;s most shameful place is &quot;plot hijacking the setting&quot;: the author, for wish-fulfillment, today says the protagonist is invincible, tomorrow lets him suffer a loss; today sets a rule, tomorrow casually breaks it. This is &quot;setting-breaking and rushed ending.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou elevates this into the highest axiom: setting self-consistency is above plot convenience; the worldview may infinitely scale without collapsing. This entry digs deep into this axiom&#39;s philosophical depth.</p><p>Here the law-first axiom itself is the theme; it simultaneously guards the other five — precisely because law is first, anti-predation, Myriad-Rank republicanism, collective uplift, and causal self-discipline will not have their settings temporarily altered by &quot;plot needs.&quot;</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-law-first-means" tabindex="-1">I. What &quot;Law-First&quot; Means <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-law-first-means" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What &quot;Law-First&quot; Means&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom&#39;s core has three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Laws are the cosmos&#39; underlying code</strong>: they do not change with any individual will — even the strongest transcended one may not bypass laws to do things (entries 809, 814).</li><li><strong>Setting self-consistency is above all</strong>: if a new plot conflicts with existing laws, change the plot, not the law. This is Document 97 Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table&#39;s philosophical source.</li><li><strong>May infinitely scale without collapsing</strong>: law-first guarantees the worldview may continuously add new content, new cosmoses, new levels, yet always be logically self-consistent.</li></ol><p>Why is it an &quot;axiom&quot; not a &quot;suggestion&quot;? Because as long as laws may be casually changed by the strong, the entire cosmos&#39; certainty is gone — Myriad Ranks cannot predict the consequences of their actions; causal self-discipline and Myriad-Rank republicanism all fail.</p><h2 id="ii-what-it-seals-off-setting-breaking-and-rushed-ending" tabindex="-1">II. What It Seals Off: Setting-Breaking and Rushed Ending <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-what-it-seals-off-setting-breaking-and-rushed-ending" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. What It Seals Off: Setting-Breaking and Rushed Ending&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom in creation and setting directly corresponds to two prohibitions:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not break settings</strong>: laws already set are not reneged on. You cannot first write &quot;energy conservation,&quot; then let the protagonist create something from nothing.</li><li><strong>Do not rush the ending</strong>: the worldview must be able to perpetually iterate to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm; cannot reach a place where logic collapses and cannot be tied up.</li></ul><p>This looks like &quot;writing technique,&quot; but is actually cosmology&#39;s seriousness. A cosmos that cannot even keep its own rules — on what basis does it ask Myriad Ranks to trust? <strong>Law-first is the cosmos&#39; good-faith promise to Myriad Ranks.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-meta-law-why-this-axiom-cannot-be-broken" tabindex="-1">III. Meta-Law: Why This Axiom Cannot Be Broken <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-meta-law-why-this-axiom-cannot-be-broken" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Meta-Law: Why This Axiom Cannot Be Broken&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom has a special status — it is &quot;the law about laws,&quot; i.e., meta-law. It cannot be broken because:</p><ul><li>If breaking it is allowed, that equals allowing &quot;changing settings for plot convenience&quot;; the other five axioms all become sacrificeable;</li><li>It guarantees Document 97-style self-consistency audit may run perpetually — Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision may continuously check &quot;whether the setting has contradictions&quot;;</li><li>It lets Heng Yuan Zhou infinitely scale: new cosmoses, new clans, new levels continuously join, yet does not blow up the worldview.</li></ul><p>Entry 709 already explained its unity with the transcended one; this entry emphasizes its philosophical depth: <strong>it is all other axioms&#39; &quot;safe.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="iv-law-first-and-plot-freedom-s-balance" tabindex="-1">IV. Law-First and Plot Freedom&#39;s Balance <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-law-first-and-plot-freedom-s-balance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Law-First and Plot Freedom&#39;s Balance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-first does not mean rigidity. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s balance:</p><ul><li><strong>Fundamental laws may not be changed</strong> (anti-predation, Myriad-Rank republicanism, energy conservation);</li><li><strong>Operating laws may be changed but follow democratic procedure</strong> (entry 814);</li><li><strong>Creative freedom exists within laws</strong>: you may tell countless wonderful stories within a self-consistent law framework, but may not break the frame.</li></ul><p>This is like chess: the rules may not be casually changed, but within the rules you may play countless games. <strong>Law-first draws boundaries for freedom, not cancels freedom.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: self-consistent settings avoid repeated waste of &quot;changing back and forth,&quot; guaranteeing the worldview perpetually usable</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: laws are not privately altered by the strong, sealing from the meta-rule &quot;the strong casually change laws for private interest&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s plot hijacks setting, is contradictory front-to-back, high in setting-breaking and rushed endings; Heng Yuan Zhou guarantees self-consistent perpetuity with law-first</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: laws stable and predictable, so Myriad Ranks may plan their own uplift path with peace of mind</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: self-consistency audit, fundamental/operating law classification, and revision procedure all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-self-consistency-audit-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Self-Consistency Audit and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-self-consistency-audit-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Self-Consistency Audit and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom is not a slogan; it runs through continuous self-consistency audits. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision periodically scans the entire worldview: have fundamental laws been secretly tampered, do new settings conflict with old laws, do operating-law revisions follow democratic procedure. The transcended one&#39;s work maintaining law self-consistency is counted into civilizational weight by its effect of &quot;avoiding setting-breaking and rushed endings, guaranteeing infinite scaling.&quot; Precisely because this meta-law is guarded this strictly, the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may continuously add new cosmoses, new clans, new levels, yet always be logically self-consistent, neither collapsing nor rotting — this is the cosmos&#39; good faith to Myriad Ranks&#39; final fulfillment.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom&#39;s philosophical depth lies in it being a &quot;meta-law&quot; — what it manages is not some specific law, but &quot;the law itself must be respected.&quot; It guarantees Heng Yuan Zhou does not break settings, does not rush endings, may infinitely scale; it writes the cosmos&#39; promise to Myriad Ranks (my rules are stable, predictable, trustworthy) into the worldview&#39;s deepest layer. When even the transcended one may not bypass laws, when plot may not hijack setting, when a cosmos may perpetually grow without collapsing, the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm truly owns a foundation that will not crack on its own. This is the law-first axiom&#39;s deepest meaning.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/709_模块4-超脱与法则优先公理的统一.html">Entry 709 · Unity of Transcendence and the Law-First Axiom</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/759_模块4-超多元级规则-法则优先公理实践.html">Entry 759 · Practice of the Law-First Axiom</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">Entry 97 · Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/851_模块4-超脱者与哲学-总论.html">Entry 851 · Transcended-One Philosophy Overview</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=t(s,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
